{
    "title": "Body Temperature\u30fbFever Tracker",
    "description": "<h1>Fever Tracker: Your Daily Companion for Tracking Body Temperature and More.</h1>\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfaf Fever Tracker is a simple and easy-to-use app designed to help you monitor your health. \r\nA fever tracker and symptom diary is a digital tool that helps individuals to track and record their body temperature and any related symptoms of illness. \r\n\r\n\u2753 What is a fever?\r\nWhen your body temperature is above the normal range, you may feel cold or pain in your muscles.\r\n\r\n\u2753 What is a Fever Tracker app?\r\nThis thermometer app helps to track the illness. It is a fever tracker and helps you track your body temperature. It includes an input field for users to record any associated symptoms they may be experiencing. The fever tracker app is also helpful because it has a warning system that alerts users if their body temperature exceeds 37.5 \u00b0C (99.5 \u00b0F). It indicates a potentially high fever. Check your temperature and put it into the app.\r\n\r\n<h2>Track body temperature and be healthy!</h2>\r\nKeep an eye on your body temperature and any related symptoms with Fever Tracker. It is a reliable fever tracker and a symptom diary app. Use a temperature app to help you keep track of your fever and determine the best course of action.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd38<b>What our Fever Tracker and thermometer app has to offer</b>:\r\n\u2733\ufe0f Self-assessment: Use Fever Tracker to get an overview of your health based on the data you enter. Use this app every day to get the most accurate and useful results\r\n\u2733\ufe0f Statistics: All data recorded in the fever tracker app is saved\r\n\u2733\ufe0f Record keeping: View all of your health records in one place. \r\n\u2733\ufe0f Medical report storage: Keep your medical reports in the app for easy access.\r\n\ud83d\udc49In addition to tracking body temperature and symptoms, the thermometer and fever tracker app also allows users to record their contacts daily. \r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd38 <b>This can be helpful</b>:\r\n\ud83d\udd16to identify the potential sources of illness;\r\n\ud83d\udd16 For contact tracing purposes;\r\n\ud83d\udd16 to check your temperature while sick or to recover. \r\nThe fever tracker app logs all data with a date and time stamp and stores it only on the user's smartphone. The Body Temperature Fever Thermometer Diary gives you everything you need to track your body temperature.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd38The main benefits of using a fever thermometer free app are:\r\n\ud83d\udc49 It serves as proof of self-control for individuals needing documentation to their employers or health authorities. \r\n\ud83d\udc49 If necessary, users can also export their data using a separate function within the app. \r\n\ud83d\udc49The app allows you to easily record temperatures, symptoms, and medication for everyone in your family\r\n\ud83d\udc49Overall, this fever thermometer free app is a helpful tool for tracking  an individual's health and well-being \ud83c\udf21\ufe0f.\r\n\u203c\ufe0fImportant Notice: this body thermometer app is a diary for recording body temperature, not a measurement tool. Call your doctor or contact the local emergency ambulance service in case of a medical emergency. You may share the data from this app to your doctor.\r\n\r\n<h2>Stay on Top of Your Health: Check the Fever - Use a Fever Tracker  App to Track Your Temperature!</h2>\r\n\r\nOur app has functionalities that relate to the following categories:\r\n- Diseases and Conditions Management\r\n- Medical Device Apps\r\n- Medication and Treatment Management\r\n\r\n<i><b> !! Disclaimer !! </b>\r\nThis app is designed to assist in tracking fever and is for informational purposes only, not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Reliance on any information provided by this app is solely at your own risk. We do not accept liability for any health issues or outcomes that may arise from using this app. Always consult a healthcare professional if you have any concerns about your health, particularly if you are experiencing fever or other symptoms. The information provided by this app should not be used to make medical decisions. By using this app, you acknowledge and agree to these terms.</i>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<h1>Fever Tracker: Your Daily Companion for Tracking Body Temperature and More.</h1><br><br>\ud83c\udfaf Fever Tracker is a simple and easy-to-use app designed to help you monitor your health. <br>A fever tracker and symptom diary is a digital tool that helps individuals to track and record their body temperature and any related symptoms of illness. <br><br>\u2753 What is a fever?<br>When your body temperature is above the normal range, you may feel cold or pain in your muscles.<br><br>\u2753 What is a Fever Tracker app?<br>This thermometer app helps to track the illness. It is a fever tracker and helps you track your body temperature. It includes an input field for users to record any associated symptoms they may be experiencing. The fever tracker app is also helpful because it has a warning system that alerts users if their body temperature exceeds 37.5 \u00b0C (99.5 \u00b0F). It indicates a potentially high fever. Check your temperature and put it into the app.<br><br><h2>Track body temperature and be healthy!</h2><br>Keep an eye on your body temperature and any related symptoms with Fever Tracker. It is a reliable fever tracker and a symptom diary app. Use a temperature app to help you keep track of your fever and determine the best course of action.<br><br>\ud83d\udd38<b>What our Fever Tracker and thermometer app has to offer</b>:<br>\u2733\ufe0f Self-assessment: Use Fever Tracker to get an overview of your health based on the data you enter. Use this app every day to get the most accurate and useful results<br>\u2733\ufe0f Statistics: All data recorded in the fever tracker app is saved<br>\u2733\ufe0f Record keeping: View all of your health records in one place. <br>\u2733\ufe0f Medical report storage: Keep your medical reports in the app for easy access.<br>\ud83d\udc49In addition to tracking body temperature and symptoms, the thermometer and fever tracker app also allows users to record their contacts daily. <br><br>\ud83d\udd38 <b>This can be helpful</b>:<br>\ud83d\udd16to identify the potential sources of illness;<br>\ud83d\udd16 For contact tracing purposes;<br>\ud83d\udd16 to check your temperature while sick or to recover. <br>The fever tracker app logs all data with a date and time stamp and stores it only on the user&#39;s smartphone. The Body Temperature Fever Thermometer Diary gives you everything you need to track your body temperature.<br><br>\ud83d\udd38The main benefits of using a fever thermometer free app are:<br>\ud83d\udc49 It serves as proof of self-control for individuals needing documentation to their employers or health authorities. <br>\ud83d\udc49 If necessary, users can also export their data using a separate function within the app. <br>\ud83d\udc49The app allows you to easily record temperatures, symptoms, and medication for everyone in your family<br>\ud83d\udc49Overall, this fever thermometer free app is a helpful tool for tracking  an individual&#39;s health and well-being \ud83c\udf21\ufe0f.<br>\u203c\ufe0fImportant Notice: this body thermometer app is a diary for recording body temperature, not a measurement tool. Call your doctor or contact the local emergency ambulance service in case of a medical emergency. You may share the data from this app to your doctor.<br><br><h2>Stay on Top of Your Health: Check the Fever - Use a Fever Tracker  App to Track Your Temperature!</h2><br><br>Our app has functionalities that relate to the following categories:<br>- Diseases and Conditions Management<br>- Medical Device Apps<br>- Medication and Treatment Management<br><br><i><b> !! Disclaimer !! </b><br>This app is designed to assist in tracking fever and is for informational purposes only, not a substitute for professional medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Reliance on any information provided by this app is solely at your own risk. We do not accept liability for any health issues or outcomes that may arise from using this app. Always consult a healthcare professional if you have any concerns about your health, particularly if you are experiencing fever or other symptoms. The information provided by this app should not be used to make medical decisions. By using this app, you acknowledge and agree to these terms.</i>",
